                            <comment id="497046" author="JIRAUSER19463" created="Mon, 29 Jun 2026 20:27:41 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;We need to support TPU Direct Storage (TDS) with Peer-to-Peer (P2P) RDMA in Lustre. This will cover changes from LNet to LLite to enable direct data transfer between Lustre and TPU memory.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Note that this work will not update or affect the existing support for GPUDirect Storage (GDS).&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
